{"lang": "zh_TW", "eventid": "act48side", "eventName": "雅賽努斯復仇記", "entryType": "ACTIVITY", "storyCode": "ME-5", "avgTag": "行動前", "storyName": "匯流", "storyInfo": "嘗試修復豎琴的緹緹發現琴有問題，卻被聽到此事的副使貝赫努趁勢奪權。貝赫努向理事官施壓，理事官不得不將贊索斯師徒關入死牢。\n", "storyList": [{"id": 0, "prop": "HEADER", "attributes": {"key": "title_test", "is_skippable": "true", "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"}}, {"id": 1, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 2, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 3, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 4, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g14_luxuriousroom", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 5, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 6, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 7, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 8, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#8$1", "posfrom": "-200,0", "posto": "-200,0", "afrom": 0.0, "ato": 1.0, "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 9, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 10, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#8$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 11, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（呼呼大睡）", "name": "米奧"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1482_1#8$1"}, {"id": 12, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（抓抓耳朵）", "name": "米奧"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1482_1#8$1"}, {"id": 13, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 14, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 15, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_closedoorheavy", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 16, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.3, "xstrength": 40.0, "ystrength": 40.0, "vibrato": 60.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 17, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.7}}, {"id": 18, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#8$1", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0, "duration": 0.7}}, {"id": 19, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.7}}, {"id": 20, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_meowlong", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 21, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1", "afrom": 0.0, "ato": 1.0, "duration": 0.7}}, {"id": 22, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 23, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 24, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#4$2", "afrom": 0.0, "ato": 1.0, "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 25, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 26, "prop": "PlayMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$loneliness_intro", "key": "$loneliness_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 27, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_meowlong", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 28, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#4$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 29, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "梅捷緹克緹！", "name": "米奧"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1482_1#4$1"}, {"id": 30, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 31, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2"}, {"id": 32, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#5$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 33, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "先不說一大早就不見人影了，現在還摔門打擾我睡覺！交換儀式用的豎琴你到底修了沒？別因為雅賽努斯太好玩了就擅離職守啊！", "name": "米奧"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1482_1#5$1"}, {"id": 34, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#12$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 35, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……豎琴修好了也沒用……", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#12$2"}, {"id": 36, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#5$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 37, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "怎麼這就放棄了？你這小丫頭留學的時候是不是沒好好上課，學藝不精，連那種小裂縫都沒辦法修復嗎？", "name": "米奧"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1482_1#5$1"}, {"id": 38, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 39, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "填充和補漆本身不難，但那道裂縫破壞的不只是豎琴——", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2"}, {"id": 40, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 41, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "還有你搖搖欲墜的心？", "name": "米奧"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1"}, {"id": 42, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 43, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "還有薩爾貢的信譽。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2"}, {"id": 44, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 45, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "什麼？", "name": "米奧"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1"}, {"id": 46, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#12$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 47, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這件克瑞斯拉豎琴是我見過的、保存最完好的文物之一。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#12$2"}, {"id": 48, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而且木製樂器有其特殊性，哪怕琴身發生一點碰撞，都可能改變它原本的音色。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#12$2"}, {"id": 49, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 50, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "所以鑑定時我們非常小心，甚至放棄了所有可能產生破壞的檢測……", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2"}, {"id": 51, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#4$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 52, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這些講解詞我在博物館聽得耳朵都長繭了——", "name": "米奧"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1482_1#4$1"}, {"id": 53, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 54, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "“根據紋飾、琴弦材質、上漆工藝判斷，這件文物確實是典型的米諾斯風格，再佐以史料證據，它極有可能是克瑞斯拉使用過的豎琴。”", "name": "米奧"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1"}, {"id": 55, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 56, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但昨天晚上修琴的時候我就覺得不對……", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$2"}, {"id": 57, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "根據裂口掉落的木屑來看，它的材質確實是古代米諾斯製琴常用的杉樹，但斷面的紋理卻不太自然。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$2"}, {"id": 58, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 59, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "英雄的武器自然由千年古樹製成，有點木紋也很正常。", "name": "米奧"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1"}, {"id": 60, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 61, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不，那不像是木材的自然紋理，反倒像是某種薩爾貢特有的保水工藝。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2"}, {"id": 62, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 63, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我曾讀過研究樂器製作的古籍。書上說，米諾斯的草木含水量充足，而薩爾貢大部分地區的氣候都相對乾燥。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2"}, {"id": 64, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "因此，哪怕是從米諾斯進口木材，也必須做一次特殊處理，以防木材因為濕度太低而開裂。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2"}, {"id": 65, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這把琴上斷面的紋理，很像是這種保水工藝的痕跡。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2"}, {"id": 66, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 67, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你是說這是一把從前的薩爾貢人用米諾斯木料仿製的豎琴，不是克瑞斯拉使用過的真品？你想太多了吧？", "name": "米奧"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1"}, {"id": 68, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 69, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我也不願意相信，但剛才，我帶著部分木屑去找了化學實驗室。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2"}, {"id": 70, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "實驗證明，木材中確實混有特殊的化學物質，是一種百年前的薩爾貢樹脂……", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2"}, {"id": 71, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#4$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 72, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嘶……", "name": "米奧"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1482_1#4$1"}, {"id": 73, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 74, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這把豎琴的外觀簡直天衣無縫，如果不進行破壞性的取樣，幾乎很難發現它是贗品，我猜赫里帕夏也並不知情。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2"}, {"id": 75, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 76, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "緹緹", "content": "得儘快把這件事告訴里底婭理事官，不能在克瑞斯拉雕像的注視下，用一把假琴換取米諾斯人的信任——"}}, {"id": 77, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#13$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 78, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.3, "xstrength": 30.0, "ystrength": 30.0, "vibrato": 50.0, "randomness": 70.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 79, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "緹緹", "content": "我得終止這場交換儀式！"}}, {"id": 80, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 81, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但梅捷緹克緹大使的任務，是順利“完成”交換儀式啊。", "name": "？？？"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#13$2"}, {"id": 82, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 83, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "貝赫努先生……", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2"}, {"id": 84, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 85, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 86, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 87, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1", "afrom": 0.0, "ato": 1.0, "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 88, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 89, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 90, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我們出使前曾向帕夏起誓。你若不能換回三城建設時期的工程資料，那怎麼還有資格頂著薩爾貢大使的名號？", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1"}, {"id": 91, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 92, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2"}, {"id": 93, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 94, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你說得沒錯，大使的工作是我的職責，但鑑定是我的專業，面對如此重大的失誤，我不可能弄虛作假。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$2"}, {"id": 95, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 96, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我說過，你並沒有政治頭腦。比起使節團的負責人，你更喜歡博物館館長這個身分。", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1"}, {"id": 97, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "文物交換儀式重要的並非“文物”，而是“交換儀式”。假琴又如何，它不是依舊可以鳴響嗎？", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1"}, {"id": 98, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#3$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 99, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "緹緹", "content": "貝赫努，你想用假琴進行交換儀式嗎？"}}, {"id": 100, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#13$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 101, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "緹緹", "content": "絕對不行！"}}, {"id": 102, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#5$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 103, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "現在真琴不知所終，交換儀式又迫在眉睫，梅捷緹克緹小姐，你還能想出什麼方法嗎？", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#5$1"}, {"id": 104, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在出使之前，米納特哈瑪儀的殿堂之上，你曾對赫里帕夏說，你喜愛米諾斯的英雄傳說，從小就想知道在現實之中何為真正的英雄氣概。", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#5$1"}, {"id": 105, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "難不成你所謂的英雄氣概，就是固執己見、我行我素，在兩國建交後的第一次文化交流活動中，令自己的國家蒙羞？", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#5$1"}, {"id": 106, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#2$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 107, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哦，我想起來了。那你和你無病呻吟、一無是處的父親，有什麼區別？", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#2$1"}, {"id": 108, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#5$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 109, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是他令你們的家族沒落，讓“娜蘇圖-瑪夏耶爾”淪為被其他貴族恥笑的名字。", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#5$1"}, {"id": 110, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是他沉溺文學、拋棄責任，甚至放棄撫養子嗣，讓自己的女兒只能從書裡，而不是從自己身上找到英雄的影子。", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#5$1"}, {"id": 111, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#13$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 112, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這件事跟我的父親無關！我喜歡米諾斯的故事只是因為——", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#13$2"}, {"id": 113, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 114, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "“我們身為薩爾貢的使節，最重要的是順利完成交換儀式，個人的執念和追求並不重要。”", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1"}, {"id": 115, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這是你的原話啊。", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1"}, {"id": 116, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 117, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2"}, {"id": 118, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 119, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我會在交換儀式前想到辦法，哪怕要耗費再多的精力和時間，也不能讓一件贗品……", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2"}, {"id": 120, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 121, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "真是冥頑不靈。", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1"}, {"id": 122, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "既然如此，在你苦思冥想的這段時間裡，我就代行梅捷緹克緹小姐的職權，替你處理薩爾貢大使本應該處理的工作好了，不過……", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1"}, {"id": 123, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 124, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我猜，在理事官和受邀賓客的眼裡，你只是一個興致勃勃的小女孩，一個在神殿做粗活的負責人，而與理事官進行談判的我——", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#1$1"}, {"id": 125, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#2$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 126, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "早就是真正的薩爾貢大使了。", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#2$1"}, {"id": 127, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 128, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$2"}, {"id": 129, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 130, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 131, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.5}}, {"id": 132, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 133, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 134, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g2_pasture", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 135, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 136, "prop": "PlayMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$normal_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 137, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 138, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 139, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1", "afrom": 0.0, "ato": 1.0, "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 140, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 141, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您好，或許您不認識我，但我最近一段時間經常造訪牧場，也算是牧馱人梅里塔的熟客了。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1"}, {"id": 142, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 143, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "麻煩您借過一下，不要靠在籬笆上了，可以嗎？", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#9$1"}, {"id": 144, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2090_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 145, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（眼皮打架）", "name": "馱獸"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2090_1#1$1"}, {"id": 146, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 147, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "打擾到您午睡並非我本意，不知一把帶著露水的青草是否能讓您滿意？", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1"}, {"id": 148, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_pcknmbrth", "volume": 1.0, "channel": "1"}}, {"id": 149, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2090_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 150, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "1", "fadetime": 1.0}}, {"id": 151, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "馱獸"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2090_1#1$1"}, {"id": 152, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 153, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我還帶了一些漿果，或許您會喜歡？", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1"}, {"id": 154, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_pcknmbrth", "volume": 1.0, "channel": "2"}}, {"id": 155, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2090_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 156, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "2", "fadetime": 1.5}}, {"id": 157, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "馱獸"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2090_1#1$1"}, {"id": 158, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 159, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唔，我實在沒有其他可以賄賂您的了，那……", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$1"}, {"id": 160, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 161, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這位先生或者女士，您需要解夢嗎？", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1"}, {"id": 162, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2090_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 163, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（用籬笆剔牙）", "name": "馱獸"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2090_1#1$1"}, {"id": 164, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 165, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1"}, {"id": 166, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 167, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "花椰菜是女生，漿果的糖分太高，青草的飽腹感又不夠，要用蘿蔔才能吸引她的注意力。", "name": "？？？"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1"}, {"id": 168, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 169, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n"}}, {"id": 170, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2080_1#8$1", "afrom": 0.0, "ato": 1.0, "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 171, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 172, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2080_1#8$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 173, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不過，也有例外。要是馱獸出現發熱的情況，連最喜歡的食物也不能把他們引走……", "name": "？？？"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2080_1#8$1"}, {"id": 174, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2080_1#2$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 175, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那就需要用葉子接滿滿一捧水，一口氣澆在他們吻部的長角上幫他們降溫，這樣就可以啦！", "name": "？？？"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2080_1#2$1"}, {"id": 176, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 177, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "梅里塔小姐對馱獸的瞭解真是深刻，原來引開馱獸也有那麼多講究。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1"}, {"id": 178, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2080_1#2$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 179, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嘿嘿，那當然了。畢竟他們也不是擅長聽人指揮的循獸，每個專業牧馱人都要掌握近百種方法，才能迅速引開馱獸。", "name": "梅里塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2080_1#2$1"}, {"id": 180, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2080_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 181, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "梅里塔", "content": "也正是因為相互理解，馱獸群才會跟牧馱人十分親近。"}}, {"id": 182, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2080_1#2$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 183, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "梅里塔", "content": "對不對啊？花椰菜——"}}, {"id": 184, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 185, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_pcknmgrwl"}}, {"id": 186, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2090_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 187, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 188, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（甩動尾巴）", "name": "馱獸"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2090_1#1$1"}, {"id": 189, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（起身離開）", "name": "馱獸"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2090_1#1$1"}, {"id": 190, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 191, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2090_1#1$1", "focus": "m", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0, "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "-150,0", "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 192, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_pcknmrn", "volume": 0.7, "channel": "3"}}, {"id": 193, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "3", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 194, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 195, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 196, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "-70,0", "duration": 0.0}}, {"id": 197, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2080_1#3$1", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "70,0", "duration": 0.0}}, {"id": 198, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 199, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2080_1#3$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 200, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "梅里塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2080_1#3$1"}, {"id": 201, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "比其他牧馱人多掌握一種引開馱獸的方法，或許也是我的天賦。", "name": "梅里塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2080_1#3$1"}, {"id": 202, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 203, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "無論如何，感謝您幫我引開花椰菜，梅里塔。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1"}, {"id": 204, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2080_1#2$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 205, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "欸，小事。", "name": "梅里塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2080_1#2$1"}, {"id": 206, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2080_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 207, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "恩底彌翁神殿的祭司能喜歡我們的馱獸牧場，說明這裡一定是個受英雄庇佑的地方，我們開心還來不及。", "name": "梅里塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2080_1#1$1"}, {"id": 208, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#7$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 209, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不會給你們添麻煩就好。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#7$1"}, {"id": 210, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2080_1#3$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 211, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "怎麼會呢？您每次來也就是看看景色和這些籬笆。", "name": "梅里塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2080_1#3$1"}, {"id": 212, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "前段時間我還覺得這些籬笆的空隙太大，會有馱獸幼獸跑丟。您善解人意，不到幾天就用堅固的絲線把空隙補起來了。", "name": "梅里塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2080_1#3$1"}, {"id": 213, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 214, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這是我應該做的。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1"}, {"id": 215, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2080_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 216, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您真是好心。對了，今天還有幾隻馱獸需要修剪蹄子，我就先不打擾您了。", "name": "梅里塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2080_1#1$1"}, {"id": 217, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 218, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 219, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2080_1#1$1", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0, "posfrom": "70,0", "posto": "210,0", "duration": 1.5, "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 220, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 221, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 222, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1"}, {"id": 223, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 224, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 225, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "posfrom": "-70,0", "posto": "200,0", "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 226, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 227, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 228, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "卡珊卓拉俯身靠近馱獸倚靠過的那塊“補過的籬笆”。纖細的絲線以精準的間隔縱向排列，在陽光下閃閃發亮。"}}, {"id": 229, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她伸手撥動了其中一根絲線，耳邊沒有傳來任何響動，只有微風照常拂過牧草。"}}, {"id": 230, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 231, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "也是，連堅固的馱獸撞上來都寂靜無聲……", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1"}, {"id": 232, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 233, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "時間不多了，你什麼時候才會再次鳴響呢？", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$1"}, {"id": 234, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 235, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 236, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.5}}, {"id": 237, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 238, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 239, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g14_luxuriousroom", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 240, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 241, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1"}}, {"id": 242, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 243, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 244, "prop": "PlayMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$nervous_intro", "key": "$nervous_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 245, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 246, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 247, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "貝赫努先生，我知道您這次到訪的來意。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 248, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 249, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "請您放心。一切以兩國關係為重，交換儀式一定會順利進行，不會受到一些小事的影響。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 250, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 251, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "小事？", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#4$1"}, {"id": 252, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#7$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 253, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "贊索斯於五年前來到雅賽努斯，在渡口擔任管理者和擺渡人，後來收了一名從祭司學院輟學的學生——呂刻伊昂，作為學徒。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#7$1"}, {"id": 254, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "兩人合謀，意圖從梅捷緹克緹大使房中竊取她的私人物品未果，現被拘留在監管所，按照治安管理流程，等候審判。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#7$1"}, {"id": 255, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 256, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "既然大使小姐不追究，那這件事——", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 257, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 258, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你所說的是那位天真的當事人、第一神殿重建的負責人對無知的民眾做出的安撫性解釋，並非一位尊貴的薩爾貢大使對此事下的判斷。", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1"}, {"id": 259, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 260, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唔，看來貝赫努先生與梅捷緹克緹小姐的觀點並不相同。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 261, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "身為理事官，我自然會對此事負責，只是兩位還需協商一致，再來告訴我如何處理。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 262, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 263, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你聽得懂我的意思，里底婭理事官，不用再試探。現在我的意見就是薩爾貢使節團的意見。", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1"}, {"id": 264, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 265, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "若要從頭追究，要不是文物交換儀式一拖再拖，怎麼會發生盜琴、毀琴的慘劇？", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#5$1"}, {"id": 266, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我甚至有理由懷疑你對兩國外交並沒有盡心盡力——儀式是你刻意拖延，而現在發生的一切，都是你的謀劃。", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#5$1"}, {"id": 267, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 268, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "聽說理事官一職是雅賽努斯行政改革後新設的職位，你在推進這項事宜上付出了很多，才擁有了今天的位置。", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1"}, {"id": 269, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "貝赫努", "content": "要是兩國正式建交後的首次文化交流活動有什麼問題……"}}, {"id": 270, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#2$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 271, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "貝赫努", "content": "恭喜你，你確實會成為唯一一位被雅賽努斯民眾記住的理事官。"}}, {"id": 272, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#7$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 273, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#7$1"}, {"id": 274, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 275, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "籌辦文物交換儀式確實是我最重要的任務，只是最近事務繁忙，所以沒能親自趕到案發現場，是我疏忽了。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 276, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不知以貝赫努……大使的觀點認為，這樁“盜琴毀琴”的慘劇，該如何定調？", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 277, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 278, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "罪犯粗魯、野蠻、無知，心懷毫無來由的仇恨情緒……刻意盜取並摔毀薩爾貢與米諾斯友誼的象徵，令人無比心寒。", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1"}, {"id": 279, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在我主管米納特哈瑪儀文化事業的三十年裡，米諾斯曾多次發函——“請薩爾貢歸還侵占時期掠奪走的文化瑰寶。”", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1"}, {"id": 280, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "既然米諾斯人對自己國家的文物如此看重，那麼那兩個竊取“國寶”的小偷，更應該從重發落，不是嗎？", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1"}, {"id": 281, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#7$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 282, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我們會按照米諾斯的法律酌情審判，不過從重發落……", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#7$1"}, {"id": 283, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 284, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "說實話，我也不希望給雅賽努斯民眾留下薩爾貢人橫行霸道的負面印象，況且這並不是我們這些愛好和平的使節想要的。", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1"}, {"id": 285, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "可惜現在的時間點太過特殊，你也知道，哪怕五年前薩爾貢和米諾斯簽署了停戰協議，也並不代表萬事安寧。", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1"}, {"id": 286, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "薩爾貢的帕夏們習慣了靠征服和實力解決問題，最好不要給他們一個發怒的理由，你覺得呢？", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1"}, {"id": 287, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#7$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 288, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#7$1"}, {"id": 289, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#8$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 290, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "贊索斯和呂刻伊昂師徒，密謀盜取並毀壞國寶，蓄意破壞文物交換儀式，包藏禍心，甚至……", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#8$1"}, {"id": 291, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 292, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "甚至有“叛國”嫌疑。", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1"}, {"id": 293, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#7$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 294, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#7$1"}, {"id": 295, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#5$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 296, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "即刻收監，關入死牢。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#5$1"}, {"id": 297, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#2$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 298, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "謝謝你，可靠的理事官小姐。我很期待幾天後的交換儀式。", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#2$1"}, {"id": 299, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 300, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 301, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 302, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 303, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "58_g14_yanprison", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 304, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "進去。", "name": "獄警"}}, {"id": 305, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 306, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_doorclose", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 307, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2"}}, {"id": 308, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 309, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 310, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 311, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 312, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 313, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "發生了什麼？按照米諾斯的法律，在判決下達之前很少會臨時轉獄。", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#5$1"}, {"id": 314, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 315, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2089_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 316, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "情況特殊，我只是聽令行事。儘量安分一點吧……說不定有爭取從輕發落的機會。", "name": "獄警"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2089_1#1$1"}, {"id": 317, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 318, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 319, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2089_1#1$1", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0, "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 320, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 321, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 322, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 323, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 324, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#5$1"}, {"id": 325, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 326, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "原來，你真的相信那個薩爾貢大使會包庇兩個搶琴的米諾斯人。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2"}, {"id": 327, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#10$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 328, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我們親耳聽到了她對治安官說的話，如果想要興師問罪，眾人圍觀的那一刻是最方便的，但她並沒有那麼做……", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#10$1"}, {"id": 329, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#10$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 330, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你永遠不知道別人心裡想的是什麼。提交文物損毀評定書，向理事官和治安官施壓……薩爾貢使節團能做的有很多。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#10$2"}, {"id": 331, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#15$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 332, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "死牢，真是看得起我們。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#15$2"}, {"id": 333, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#13$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 334, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你應該後悔的，呂刻伊昂，撞毀旅店廚房與現在加在我們身上的罪名比起來，幾乎算不上什麼。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#13$2"}, {"id": 335, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#6$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 336, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那從強盜手中奪回本就屬於我們的東西更不能有罪。克瑞斯拉的豎琴只為英雄的故事歌唱，它不會也不該為虛假的和平奏響。", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#6$1"}, {"id": 337, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我知道您的過去，贊索斯老師。雖然我沒有親歷過戰爭，但我尊重您的決定，我不可能在明知計劃的情況下讓您一個人冒險。", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#6$1"}, {"id": 338, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 339, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "兩年前，是您救了我的命。", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#4$1"}, {"id": 340, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 341, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在你被源石碎片劃傷之後，把你從練習射箭的草場上連夜背下來的是你在祭司學院的同窗，赫卡德墨。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2"}, {"id": 342, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#3$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 343, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我只是收留了一個不願繼續從事神職的學生，僅此而已。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#3$2"}, {"id": 344, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 345, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "感染之後，我不可能再成為祭司——那是與眾英雄溝通、為米諾斯人指引方向的神聖工作，我無法完成。", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#8$1"}, {"id": 346, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#3$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 347, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "至於赫卡德墨，他只是捨不得一個與他進行口舌之爭的對手……", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#3$1"}, {"id": 348, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 349, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不要欺騙自己，呂刻伊昂。那樣只會讓你在不得不面對真相時，獲得更大的苦痛。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2"}, {"id": 350, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 351, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "贊索斯老師？", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#5$1"}, {"id": 352, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 353, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我的摯友領受神諭來到我的故鄉時，帶來了移動城市裡的技術，在荒蕪的沼地中與我們一起建造村落。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2"}, {"id": 354, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "村裡的人都很尊敬他，但每到深夜他總會滿面愁容。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2"}, {"id": 355, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#15$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 356, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我當時欺騙自己，也試圖說服他——你夢中的河流並非被鮮血染紅，那是河流從上游帶來的鐵砂，你的神諭就是來到我們身邊。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#15$2"}, {"id": 357, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 358, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但他並不相信……", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1"}, {"id": 359, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#11$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 360, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他早就做好了奔赴戰地的準備，是我一直自欺欺人。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#11$2"}, {"id": 361, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 362, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#4$1"}, {"id": 363, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 364, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 0.5}}, {"id": 365, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "河……哈哈……這年頭竟然還有傻小子因為夢到這些，就跑去跟薩爾貢人拼命？", "name": "低啞的聲音"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#4$1"}, {"id": 366, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而且，你們兩個也是為了搶薩爾貢人的東西才被抓進來的？", "name": "低啞的聲音"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#4$1"}, {"id": 367, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#16$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 368, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#4$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 369, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "老先生，克瑞斯拉的豎琴是失落的文物，是我們米諾斯人自己的東西。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#16$2"}, {"id": 370, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 371, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那就更不值了啊……", "name": "低啞的聲音"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#16$2"}, {"id": 372, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 373, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1", "afrom": 0.0, "ato": 1.0, "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 374, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 375, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "自百年前薩爾貢人侵占米諾斯的國土之後，現在哪還有什麼東西，是完完全全屬於我們的？", "name": "乞丐？"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1"}, {"id": 376, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 377, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 378, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 379, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 380, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 381, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 382, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": ""}}], "OPTIONTRACE": true}